Photos no longer disappear. If your phone unloaded the app while you were picking shots in the gallery, they come back on their own — no need to choose them again.

You can change your password right in settings, and password recovery by email works again.

Widgets: "Days together" counts from your own date, the couple widget no longer mixes two pairs, and the "our photos" switch shows what actually happened.

A time capsule shows up in the feed on the day it opens. Your own colouring page opens instead of a blank sheet. The chat in the watch room can be hidden. The date a wish came true can be corrected.
